{"unit_id":"EmotionTowel__dsh-session-header#card-zh","repo":"EmotionTowel/dsh-session-header","commit":"7039e1ddd994835cf0986ac2c4d67093cd2ebaf7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 是 DSH 插件，为模型提供方请求添加当前会话 ID HTTP 头，也可配置固定值。它利用 LLM 调用上下文包装 fetch；配置 URL 前缀后，还能为匹配的工具请求加头，并按需替换指定已有头。适合需要把会话标识传给模型网关的用户。无需 API key。适用于已配置网关。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:35-66","index.js:124-157","index.js:175-230","cordis.patch.yml:13-22"]}
