{"unit_id":"EmotionTowel__dsh-session-header#feature-1","repo":"EmotionTowel/dsh-session-header","commit":"7039e1ddd994835cf0986ac2c4d67093cd2ebaf7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「模型请求携带会话 ID」：在 LLM 流执行期间为 fetch 请求添加配置的头名和当前调用会话 ID；也可设置固定值。已有同名头默认保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:124-157","index.js:175-195"]}
{"unit_id":"EmotionTowel__dsh-session-header#feature-2","repo":"EmotionTowel/dsh-session-header","commit":"7039e1ddd994835cf0986ac2c4d67093cd2ebaf7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「限定工具请求注入」：配置 toolEndpoints 后，工具执行期间只有匹配 URL 前缀的 fetch 请求才加入会话头；可通过 overwriteHeaders 指定允许替换的既有头。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:49-66","index.js:202-230"]}
{"unit_id":"EmotionTowel__dsh-session-header#caveat-1","repo":"EmotionTowel/dsh-session-header","commit":"7039e1ddd994835cf0986ac2c4d67093cd2ebaf7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 使用前须知：模型请求会携带当前调用的会话 ID 到其目标服务；工具执行期只有配置的 URL 前缀匹配时才加入会话头。目标地址由 DSH/provider 配置决定。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:124-157","index.js:202-230"]}
